{"series":{"id":"zhu-tian-ji","slug":"zhu-tian-ji","title":"Zhu Tian Ji","image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-01/zt%20an.jpg?itok=55HLMO2c","synopsis":"La leyenda dice que cuando el Abismo Negro llega a existir, un evento cataclísmico destruirá todos los mundos y reiniciará el universo. Lin Fei, un joven, era incapaz de cultivar debido a un defecto en sus venas y confiaba en su astucia para vivir y morir en la Secta de la Espada. Tiene que aprender un antiguo método de forja de armas para vengar la muerte de su maestro y morir con el demonio Emperador del Abismo. Renace en una nueva era de reinicio debido a la intervención de una fuerza","status":"En Emisión","year":2022,"genres":[],"type":"donghua","src":"donghualife","sourceUrls":["https://donghualife.com/series/zhu-tian-ji"],"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T17:20:12.580Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"zhu-tian-ji-t1","slug":"zhu-tian-ji-t1","seriesId":"zhu-tian-ji","number":1,"image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-01/zt%20an.jpg?itok=55HLMO2c","updatedAt":"2026-09-19T17:20:12.580Z","episodeCount":26}],"episodes":[{"id":"zhu-tian-ji-t1-e25","slug":"zhu-tian-ji-t1-e25","title":"zhu-tian-ji-1-x25","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/episode/zhu-tian-ji-1-x25","servers":[{"name":"ok.ru","url":"https://ok.ru/videoembed/3522074446554","embed":true}],"seriesId":"zhu-tian-ji","seasonId":"zhu-tian-ji-t1","number":25,"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T17:29:29.011Z"},{"id":"zhu-tian-ji-t1-e26","slug":"zhu-tian-ji-t1-e26","title":"zhu-tian-ji-1-x26","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/episode/zhu-tian-ji-1-x26","servers":[{"name":"ok.ru","url":"https://ok.ru/videoembed/3537244261082","embed":true}],"seriesId":"zhu-tian-ji","seasonId":"zhu-tian-ji-t1","number":26,"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T17:29:29.017Z"},{"id":"zhu-tian-ji-t1-e24","slug":"zhu-tian-ji-t1-e24","title":"zhu-tian-ji-1-x24","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/episode/zhu-tian-ji-1-x24","servers":[{"nam